-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications made by VibeDownloader
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The vendored file is electron/vendor/snapsave-downloader/src/index.js. It is
byte-for-byte unmodified. All VibeDownloader-specific behaviour lives OUTSIDE
this file, in electron/utils/instagramStories.ts, which:

  - wraps this module rather than modifying it,
  - overrides the provider's `developer` field, which hard-codes the upstream
    author's handle, so our responses and filenames never leak it,
  - derives media type, duration and stable ids from the provider's own
    signed-token payloads instead of trusting its response fields,
  - deduplicates the tray, which the provider returns with repeated items.

The Express wrapper from the upstream project (which emitted `developer: "Naeem"`
and filenames prefixed "VibeDownloader.me - ") was deliberately NOT vendored.
VibeDownloader calls the library directly, so that wrapper never runs.

